    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="3eb17061-5d74-5104-b413-c324e3794258" activityNameId="db069586-7688-5575-85cb-6cdaf68c7f1e" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Sawn timber, Scandinavian softwood, raw, plant-debarked, u=70%, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Sawn timber, Scandinavian softwood, raw, plant-debarked, u=70%, at plant
The multi-output process "sawing / debarking, scandinavian softwood, at plant" delivers the coproducts "sawn timber, scandinavian softwood, raw, plant-debarked, u=70%,at plant", "chips, scandinavian softwood (plant-debarked), u=70%, at plant" and "sawdust, scandinavian softwood (plant-debarked), u=70%, at plant". The allocation is based on the prices of the different outputs.;
UUID: 952cee7b-d171-3741-ad76-b3f80baeb85a
This module includes the debarking and the further production of sawn timber, wood chips and sawdust in a Scandinavian sawmill. The transport of the wood from the forest road to the sawmill is included.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Modern technology used nowadays in Sweden and Finnland
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_952cee7b-d171-3741-ad76-b3f80baeb85a.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
